OL,3,GNEWSAHuntingdon train knifeman guilty
OL,4,Aof trying to murder 14
OL,5,
OL,6,FA knifeman has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fattempting to murder 14 people,
OL,8,Fincluding 10 on board a train to
OL,9,FLondon.
OL,11,FPassengers on the Doncaster to King's
OL,12,FCross service fought off Anthony
OL,13,FWilliams, 33, with a frying pan and a
OL,14,Ftoaster as the attack unfolded on 1
OL,15,FNovember 2025.
OL,17,FSome hid in toilets and bike racks
OL,18,Fbefore the driver was forced to make an
OL,19,Funscheduled stop in Huntingdon,
OL,20,FCambridgeshire, where Williams was
OL,21,Farrested by armed police.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
