OL,3,GNEWSAHuntingdon train knifeman guilty
OL,4,Aof trying to murder 14
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as the train attacks, Williams,
OL,7,Fof Langford Road, Peterborough, was
OL,8,Ffound guilty of attempting to murder
OL,9,Ffour other people in separate incidents
OL,10,Fand will be sentenced at Cambridge
OL,11,FCrown Court on 4 and 5 February.
